    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>重要公告</span></p><span></span><p><span>家人们，七条饭局粉丝群诚邀你来入席！</span></p><span></span><p><span>查看群公告找饭局小助理来跟我们约饭吧~</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾</span></p><span></span><p><span>主持人：富富子</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：蛋蛋</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期你将会听到：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="152">02:32</a> i“姐狗”人集合！先从最近磕的CP聊起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="422">07:02</a> CP也能量产，泰国人卖腐已经卖出新产业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1116">18:36</a> 现场亲亲、见家长、拍婚礼短片，我们经历过的泰腐营业名场面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1418">23:38</a> 承认卖腐、指责粉丝，还有什么是这些过世CP干不出来的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1646">27:26</a> 属于CP粉的战斗时刻——CP拆了也不妨碍粉丝贴脸开大</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1845">30:45</a> 湾湾CP：后来居上、敢干敢卖、且磕且珍惜！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a> 见过蒸煮直接在粉丝面前搂着嫂子走机场的场面吗？我们见过！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2457">40:57</a> “永远的第一名”——回顾一下我们的湾湾CP“白月光”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2864">47:44</a> 几乎不卖的日本CP，适合各位抠糖党！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3151">52:31</a> 赞美《美丽的他》！赞美久八！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3514">58:34</a> 《恋爱至上主义区域》、《语义错误》——肥而不腻的韩国CP请磕！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3885">1:04:45</a> 当我们在磕CP时我们在磕什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4140">1:09:00</a> 最后是必不可少的安利环节！</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Billkin - กดกน (Skyline) (Ost.แปลรกฉนดวยใจเธอ)</span></p><span></span><p><span>SYML - Wildfire (Alternate Version)</span></p>]]></description>
